description: gpy theme use
expression: help
---
Switch to a theme

Usage: gpy theme use [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  Theme name

Options:
      --force  Apply the theme's recommended layout/config (segment order, directory display, language icons, …), preserving any settings you've explicitly configured
  -h, --help   Print help
